# Copy this file to `.dev.vars` for standalone (non-WebDIY) local secrets.
# `.dev.vars` is gitignored — never commit real keys.
#
# On WebDIY there is nothing to set here: managed public values arrive in
# `.env` and secrets are injected as Worker bindings at dev-server start.

# --- Neon Auth + Data API --------------------------------------------------
# On WebDIY these are provisioned automatically when the project enables the
# database integration: the VITE_NEON_* public values are managed in `.env`,
# and NEON_AUTH_COOKIE_SECRET is delivered as a secret binding. For standalone
# use outside WebDIY: put the VITE_NEON_* values in `.env` (they are public
# endpoint URLs) and generate the cookie secret below yourself — it signs the
# auth proxy's session cache cookie (any high-entropy value ≥32 chars works,
# e.g. `openssl rand -base64 32`).
#
# NEON_AUTH_COOKIE_SECRET=your-generated-cookie-secret
